WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.657
Duplicates can quietly inflate totals, counts, and frequencies.

00:00:04.657 --> 00:00:13.482
Duplicated identifies the repeated row where order ID two and amount seventy-two appear a second time.

00:00:13.482 --> 00:00:16.802
Drop_duplicates removes the exact duplicate.

00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:21.537
The important question is whether the repetition is truly an error.

00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:29.002
Two legitimate orders can have the same amount, so we should understand the record definition before deleting anything.

00:00:29.002 --> 00:00:33.790
Here the example is intentionally an exact duplicate for teaching purposes.
